# Inject Dispatchers

Never use `Dispatchers.Default`, `Dispatchers.IO`, or `Dispatchers.Main` directly in production (`*Main`) code.

Bind them once in `dispatchersModule` (`DefaultDispatcher` / `IoDispatcher` qualifiers in `:core:common`) and inject `CoroutineDispatcher` at call sites.

```kotlin
// ❌ BAD
CoroutineScope(SupervisorJob() + Dispatchers.Default)
.setQueryCoroutineContext(Dispatchers.IO)

// ✅ GOOD
CoroutineScope(SupervisorJob() + get<CoroutineDispatcher>(DefaultDispatcher))
.setQueryCoroutineContext(get<CoroutineDispatcher>(IoDispatcher))
```

Exceptions: test code (`*Test`), and the single binding site inside `dispatchersModule`.
